OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fin the west at first otherwise it will
OL,7,Fbe dry with clear spells in the east.
OL,8,FCloud will spread east from after
OL,9,Fmidnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FBright spells and mostly dry
OL,12,Fin the morning. Cloud and rain, some
OL,13,Fheavy, spread south later in the
OL,14,Fafternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
