OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday continues cloudy with rain.
OL,7,FWednesday night, Thursday morning stay
OL,8,Fdry with a further band of cloud and
OL,9,Frain passing southeast Thursday night.
OL,10,FFriday will become dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
